		<constant name="GROUP_SUBGIZMO" value="1073741823">
			Subgizmo id standing for the whole selection when it is more than one point, or has connections. Scripts can only give Godot one subgizmo id, so this one carries the move widget for all of them: its transform is their centre, and moving it moves every point in [method group_points].
		</constant>
